00:23:05.588 --> 00:23:07.912
- Close call huh?
- It was a close call yeah.

00:23:07.912 --> 00:23:09.720
I mean the good news is
you know everybody makes it

00:23:09.720 --> 00:23:12.262
'cause it's a close call,
it's not like morbid,

00:23:12.262 --> 00:23:14.770
