and see the train is coming

00:23:30.958 --> 00:23:32.873
and you're like--
- What?

00:23:32.873 --> 00:23:34.808
- You're standing--
- Coming the wrong way.

00:23:34.808 --> 00:23:37.607
- On the rail, you're standing halfway

00:23:37.607 --> 00:23:40.299
and at the last second he
turned 'cause he heard it

00:23:40.299 --> 00:23:43.012
and got out of the way
but it was a close call.

00:23:43.012 --> 00:23:43.922
- Very close call.

00:23:43.922 --> 00:23:46.197
- I mean that was disconcerting man.

00:23:46.197 --> 00:23:48.697
And all types of these things.

00:23:49.750 --> 00:23:53.514
It just made me think ever since then,

00:23:53.514 --> 00:23:56.455
